docs\WORKFLOW.md:330:- A live smoke test confirmed successful Playwright import, Chromium launch, localhost HTTP 200, and GraManna page load. Browser and temporary server cleanup also passed.
docs\WORKFLOW.md:333:- If the shared interpreter or browser becomes unavailable, report the specific failure before using an alternative validation method. Do not assume Playwright is unavailable simply because the default Python or Node environment cannot import it.
