      <div class="section-inner">
        <h1 id="about-title">About Ovis Alms Foundation</h1>
        <p class="placeholder-text">What if helping someone in need├óΓé¼ΓÇ¥near or far├óΓé¼ΓÇ¥could be as simple as the desire to do so? And what if donors could hear firsthand from the very people whose lives their charity touched?</p>
        <p class="placeholder-text">Those questions grew out of something often overlooked in the donor experience. A receipt may confirm that a donation was successful, and a report may describe the good an organization accomplishes, but neither can replace hearing directly from a recipient about the difference it made. Ovis Alms Foundation was founded on the conviction that this missing voice is essential to completing the charitable continuum. GraManna, now in development, is the mobile-friendly digital platform through which we hope to bring that vision to life.</p>
